 "notes": "The tutorial. A trapdoor drops whoever gets to the exit door first onto the lower level and seals shut, so the pair are split across two levels. The lower player pulls a lever to open the upper door; after that each works along their own level, opening doors for the other with plates and levers (each tutorial arrow teaches one thing). At the end the upper floor stops, the upper player drops down, and they leave together.",
